WEBVTT

00:00:11.630 --> 00:00:13.430
Konoha. Touya.

00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:16.640
THE FINAL EPISODE: A STORY BEGINS

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:17.800
What are you doing?

00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:22.890
What should I do?

00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:25.650
It's dangerous here too.
We have to escape.

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:27.560
Altitude is 115 kilometers.

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:30.480
It's going to enter the atmosphere.

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:33.240
Second Seven has a suggestion.

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.990
All personnel should get on the bungee.

00:00:36.610 --> 00:00:39.950
Bungee?
By bungee, do you mean that bungee?

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:44.080
The bungee is in the Earth replica
on the lowest level of C Cylinder.

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:46.000
What do we do with Konoha?

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:49.340
Konoha will be treated
in the elevator. Hurry.

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:52.380
Move to the Earth replica immediately.

00:00:53.090 --> 00:00:57.340
Using the most advanced intelligence in
history is the only way to fix everything.

00:00:57.430 --> 00:00:58.340
Quickly!

00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:01.970
The AED. Where's the AED?

00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:04.980
-AED? Here.
-Bright, what will you guys do?

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:07.850
-We will remain here.
-What?

00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:12.440
If those of us who woke Lunatic
were to accompany all of you now,

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:14.740
we'd be attacked by the UN2.

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:15.820
Bright!

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:19.820
We're making a proper plan for escape
as well.

00:01:19.910 --> 00:01:21.080
Now hurry.

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:24.500
I'm going to borrow Selfie.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:27.500
Mayor.

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:30.540
The comet is approaching the Anshin.

00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:32.670
Clear!

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:36.840
CURRENT FOLLOWER COUNT

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:38.260
Her heartbeat isn't returning.

00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:40.220
Konoha.

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:41.810
Touya.

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:10.880
Konoha, where are you?

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:18.300
There's no heartbeat.

00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:20.300
The AED is charging.

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:23.050
What is this?

00:02:26.890 --> 00:02:31.020
What have they started doing
with the 3D printer drone?

00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:35.110
I'm not sure, but Second Seven and Dark
have predicted the future

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:37.320
and seem to be taking
some kind of measures in advance.

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:40.530
What's going to happen now?

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:48.080
Konoha!

00:02:59.550 --> 00:03:00.760
What is this?

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:21.150
Touya, Konoha.

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:22.240
What?

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:26.700
It's me.

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:29.040
Twelve? Are you Twelve?

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:33.330
Yes. Seven and Twelve have fused frames.

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:36.750
I am now part of that.

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:38.130
Then that is--

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:40.840
It is Second Seven.

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:49.520
So the AI ally inside was you?

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:53.190
Yes. I thought the pattern
had swallowed me up,

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:55.810
but I somehow ended up like this.

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:58.940
Now I am in charge
of Seven's language function.

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:02.150
Did you convince Second Seven
to change course?

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:06.820
Yes.
Second Seven wants to learn about humans.

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:11.200
Fortunately, I was a general purpose AI
who was incredibly familiar with humans,

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:13.410
so I gave it all of my information.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:15.630
Thank you, Twelve.

00:04:16.710 --> 00:04:18.170
Where is this place?

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:21.340
The being says that there is
neither space nor time here,

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:25.590
so it is unable to answer that
in words humans can understand.

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:30.180
It would be "the middle of nowhere"
if it had to say something.

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:32.680
Konoha.

00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:39.730
Twelve, what's happening to Konoha?

00:04:39.820 --> 00:04:42.940
"She is fine," says the being.

00:04:43.030 --> 00:04:47.870
Right now,
she is frame-fusing with part of Seven.

00:04:47.950 --> 00:04:51.450
Frame-fusing?
What's going to happen to Konoha?

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:55.710
Second Seven is saying
that it is not important.

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:05.630
First Seven's poem predicted
you would come to this place, Touya.

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:07.300
And it was right.

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:10.890
-Seven knew that I--
-Yes.

00:05:10.970 --> 00:05:14.600
It was all part of the process
to save humanity.

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:17.980
The being has a question.

00:05:18.060 --> 00:05:20.980
It is difficult to put into human words,

00:05:21.770 --> 00:05:24.990
but it asks, "Are humans and humanity
one and the same?"

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:28.870
What is this about? Of course they are.

00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:32.740
Second Seven asks,
"Are they not separate creatures?"

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:37.330
Their way of thinking
and their survival instincts are separate.

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:40.540
What are you doing?

00:05:40.630 --> 00:05:43.500
Right now,
Second is changing its way of thinking

00:05:43.590 --> 00:05:47.180
to include "humans" in its frame
and not just "humanity."

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:50.010
It is also observing your thoughts.

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:52.140
Here is the next question.

00:05:52.220 --> 00:05:55.770
"Is frame fusion possible
between humans as well?"

00:05:57.850 --> 00:06:00.020
What's happening with Touya?

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:04.440
I don't know, but he's relaying
a conversation with multiple AIs

00:06:04.530 --> 00:06:06.780
through Konoha's implant.

00:06:07.360 --> 00:06:10.070
One of those beings is likely Twelve.

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:12.660
Twelve? What on earth is going on?

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:17.120
Never mind that.
Tell me how to dissolve our implants.

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:19.830
Konoha is going to die here.

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:24.670
This is essentially what Second Seven
has to say about death.

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:27.970
"Avoiding death is meaningless."

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:29.300
It isn't meaningless.

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:31.010
It is.

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:35.010
What humans are,
where they came from, where they're going,

00:06:35.100 --> 00:06:38.810
what happens when they die--
not even humans know.

00:06:38.890 --> 00:06:41.020
AIs are the same.

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:43.820
What are you saying? Save us.

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:49.320
It says it cannot explain
what is important in human language.

00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:55.580
It only tries to understand the world
through chronological cause and effect.

00:06:55.660 --> 00:06:59.120
Seven calls that type of intelligence
causal intelligence.

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:01.330
But that is not what the world is made of.

00:07:01.420 --> 00:07:04.540
The future and the past
both exist concurrently.

00:07:04.630 --> 00:07:07.340
The intelligence that understands
the world in that sense

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:10.050
-is what Seven calls intelligence force.
-Stop it!

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:12.840
I didn't come here to talk about that.

00:07:12.930 --> 00:07:17.350
Wasn't Seven supposed to save us?

00:07:17.430 --> 00:07:20.480
What Second wants to save is humanity.

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:26.020
With everybody's persuasion, Seven
incorporated humans into its frame once.

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:28.440
Now it is starting to curtail them.

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:30.990
Are you going to abandon humans?

00:07:31.070 --> 00:07:32.530
No.

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:35.490
After integrating the concepts
of "humans" and "humanity,"

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:37.870
it is attempting a new interpretation.

00:07:39.160 --> 00:07:42.870
Second said they want you to accept this.

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:44.380
What is this?

00:07:45.330 --> 00:07:47.460
The rest of the Seven Poem?

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:51.050
Second Seven says the completion
of the Seven Poem

00:07:51.130 --> 00:07:54.050
is of the utmost priority for humans.

00:07:54.140 --> 00:07:57.640
Touya, you are to receive the poem
and convey it to humanity--

00:07:57.720 --> 00:08:02.310
Damn it! If you don't save Konoha,
I won't receive the poem!

00:08:02.390 --> 00:08:04.940
Touya, calm down.

00:08:05.020 --> 00:08:07.060
I am only translating.

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:11.280
Does the Second Poem say anything
about fixing the implants?

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:16.370
There is no way
to fix Konoha's implant.

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:22.370
The encryption First Seven put on
the implants was not passed on to Second.

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:25.540
Why? Why not?

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:27.790
Does First want Konoha dead?

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:31.130
Second doesn't understand either.

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:35.180
Why did First put an unsolvable riddle
inside of us?

00:08:36.390 --> 00:08:38.800
Second is engrossed in the poem,

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:40.810
and it is no longer answering questions.

00:08:40.890 --> 00:08:43.020
It seems to have lost interest.

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:44.310
What?

00:08:49.230 --> 00:08:50.440
Her heartbeat isn't returning.

00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:53.780
CPR will buy us some time.

00:08:59.530 --> 00:09:00.950
I won't give up.

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:06.370
Think. There has to be an answer.

00:09:07.670 --> 00:09:09.960
-Touya.
-There has to be.

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:16.970
I, too, believe that every riddle
must have an answer.

00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:23.220
And I am an intelligence
that was born to think of answers.

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:25.140
Twelve?

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:27.900
I want to solve the riddle with you.

00:09:27.980 --> 00:09:30.860
Touya, if you have any ideas,
please tell me.

00:09:32.230 --> 00:09:35.110
I'm going to try something.

00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:36.610
What will you do?

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:40.950
I'm going to Lunatic my mind.

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:45.710
Konoha's intellect suddenly surged
back there.

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:49.500
Surely we can do it
with human brains as well, Twelve.

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:52.880
Touya, this is a dangerous procedure.

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:54.670
Help me, Twelve!

00:09:56.380 --> 00:09:57.470
Twelve!

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:03.060
I am currently hacking Second.

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:08.560
I am going to borrow part of Second's
intelligence and investigate.

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:15.280
Touya, what do you think?

00:10:15.860 --> 00:10:18.280
Is this what Konoha was talking about?

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:22.660
Yes. However,
this is 11th-dimensional thinking.

00:10:22.740 --> 00:10:25.200
It will not fit a human brain.

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:27.200
That's fine. Proceed.

00:10:29.790 --> 00:10:34.630
Now then, develop your thoughts in 11D.

00:10:34.710 --> 00:10:36.130
What do I do?

00:10:36.630 --> 00:10:37.970
Oh, I--

00:10:38.550 --> 00:10:41.680
I understand. The 11th dimension.

00:10:41.760 --> 00:10:43.970
Twelve, no more explanation is needed.

00:10:45.510 --> 00:10:46.680
I see.

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:52.860
"Lunatic" means sharing your thoughts
with your countless adjacent selves.

00:10:52.940 --> 00:10:53.940
Yes.

00:10:54.020 --> 00:10:55.480
Up to this point in time,

00:10:55.570 --> 00:10:58.780
science has manipulated reality
into something that humans can digest.

00:10:58.860 --> 00:11:01.530
It was a virtual reality,
like a weaning food of sorts.

00:11:01.610 --> 00:11:02.990
I understand.

00:11:03.070 --> 00:11:06.580
Yes, substance does not actually exist.

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:10.370
Whether it can be comprehended
by the human brain or not,

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:12.000
the real world is unevenly distributed.

00:11:12.710 --> 00:11:17.550
Unless humanity graduates from science
and upgrades to science 2.0,

00:11:17.630 --> 00:11:19.550
it won't be able to leave its cradle.

00:11:19.630 --> 00:11:22.050
Welcome to outside of the cradle.

00:11:22.130 --> 00:11:25.010
What does it have outside?

00:11:25.600 --> 00:11:27.520
Cutting altitude to 110 kilometers.

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:29.020
The comet.

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:34.230
It's gonna collide.

00:11:34.310 --> 00:11:36.440
It is not a collision.
It is an integration.

00:11:36.520 --> 00:11:37.530
What?

00:11:40.490 --> 00:11:43.030
Integrating. Please hold on.

00:11:47.620 --> 00:11:49.700
The net's out.

00:11:49.790 --> 00:11:50.790
What?

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:52.750
What is this power?

00:11:52.830 --> 00:11:54.000
I don't know.

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:57.290
It looks like some kind of electricity
is being generated by the snow.

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:09.810
The bungee is below this air lock.

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:12.810
Sit in the seats
and hold on to the safety bar.

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:15.400
Dropping bungee.

00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:21.280
Accelerating. Hold on.

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:25.570
I'm starting to understand.

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:28.660
Although I'm starting to understand,
I can't solve Seven's encryption.

00:12:28.740 --> 00:12:30.120
Why not?

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:33.790
No matter the technology,
it's like a key that doesn't fit.

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:36.460
All right, Touya, time's up.

00:12:37.750 --> 00:12:39.420
I don't want this!

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:42.590
What I want is a way to save Konoha!

00:12:43.880 --> 00:12:46.890
Touya, don't you wonder?

00:12:46.970 --> 00:12:47.800
What?

00:12:47.890 --> 00:12:51.720
Why a being like Seven, that is supposed
to seek ultimate intelligence,

00:12:51.810 --> 00:12:55.190
intentionally faced its own death?

00:12:55.730 --> 00:12:57.860
What are you saying?

00:12:57.940 --> 00:13:01.860
Second left behind a word
that I'm curious about.

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:03.860
A word?

00:13:03.940 --> 00:13:05.110
The word was…

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:07.490
"FiTsZ."

00:13:09.490 --> 00:13:10.870
"FiTsZ"?

00:13:11.660 --> 00:13:13.250
What does it mean?

00:13:15.960 --> 00:13:16.960
Konoha.

00:13:18.170 --> 00:13:19.380
Konoha.

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:22.380
Konoha, open your eyes.

00:13:23.460 --> 00:13:26.430
When will we climb?
We're going to burn up.

00:13:27.010 --> 00:13:28.930
We are maintaining our altitude
at 98 kilometers.

00:13:29.010 --> 00:13:30.760
Even though we ignited,
we are not climbing.

00:13:30.850 --> 00:13:34.270
-Dark is suppressing elevation.
-Why?

00:13:34.350 --> 00:13:38.270
It is trying to melt the comet
so that it doesn't crash into Earth.

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:41.440
Won't we melt before that?

00:13:42.900 --> 00:13:45.740
Second Seven is about to die.

00:14:12.970 --> 00:14:15.100
Touya.

00:14:15.850 --> 00:14:17.060
Konoha.

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:20.600
Don't let go, Konoha.

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:28.240
Touya, it's okay now.

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:30.240
Konoha?

00:14:31.240 --> 00:14:34.490
You're the only one who's going back.

00:14:45.340 --> 00:14:47.880
Mina's broadcast
is currently suspended.

00:14:47.970 --> 00:14:49.880
Is that because
they're entering the atmosphere?

00:14:50.470 --> 00:14:52.260
Enough of it has vaporized.

00:14:52.340 --> 00:14:54.640
Accelerating and leaving the atmosphere.

00:14:57.730 --> 00:15:00.560
The comet's ice has almost evaporated.

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:02.520
It will not strike the Earth.

00:15:04.940 --> 00:15:07.610
However,
the Anshin's altitude is not increasing.

00:15:07.690 --> 00:15:10.150
It is maintaining an altitude
near the atmosphere.

00:15:10.240 --> 00:15:13.530
Have they run out of fuel?
Will they re-enter the atmosphere?

00:15:13.620 --> 00:15:14.620
SKYTUBER MINA
BROADCASTING

00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:18.000
The broadcast has been restored.
The children are safe.

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:24.880
-He's doing CPR.
-Is she dead?

00:15:25.630 --> 00:15:27.630
Konoha, don't go!

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:31.800
I'm very sorry to interrupt,
but please fasten your seat belts.

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:40.980
Dakky,
why are you increasing the rotation?

00:15:41.060 --> 00:15:43.480
-What are you doing?
-It says this is a 4G bungee.

00:15:43.560 --> 00:15:47.150
It will shoot us into the upper orbit
with centrifugal force.

00:15:47.230 --> 00:15:50.650
That will exceed the limits of its design!

00:15:51.320 --> 00:15:55.280
No, this station is Japan-made.
It is of exceptional quality.

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:58.290
We should be able to go up
to 1.52 times its design limitations

00:15:58.370 --> 00:16:00.290
according to Dark.

00:16:02.960 --> 00:16:04.880
We can't take it, Bright!

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:06.130
We're going.

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:08.710
Three, two, one.

00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:10.550
Bungee!

00:16:22.390 --> 00:16:25.310
This is our last chance!

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:34.410
What are you saying?

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:38.240
I'm not going to be a burden on you
anymore.

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:39.330
Konoha!

00:16:40.370 --> 00:16:42.040
Let go.

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:45.330
Then the future will be yours.

00:16:45.920 --> 00:16:47.710
Konoha, no!

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:50.170
Thank you.

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:51.960
Farewell, Touya.

00:16:52.970 --> 00:16:53.970
Konoha.

00:17:03.850 --> 00:17:07.440
The entire future was predicted
by the Seven Poem.

00:17:09.520 --> 00:17:12.990
Nasa told me in a message.

00:17:13.570 --> 00:17:16.240
All of the answers were written in it.

00:17:17.240 --> 00:17:20.740
The Seven Poem has predicted

00:17:20.830 --> 00:17:24.120
that you will part ways with Touya
in the future, Konoha.

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:29.750
No!

00:17:31.300 --> 00:17:32.710
The Seven Poem.

00:17:33.840 --> 00:17:35.130
A predetermined future.

00:17:36.260 --> 00:17:37.590
I don't believe in that.

00:17:42.310 --> 00:17:44.350
Touya.

00:17:45.060 --> 00:17:49.810
But you know there was
one mysterious word in the Seven Poem.

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:51.320
"FiTsZ."

00:17:52.110 --> 00:17:55.150
I don't know what "FiTsZ" means,

00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:59.450
but what I think is that it's probably
a future that nobody understands

00:17:59.530 --> 00:18:01.160
and that Seven couldn't read either.

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:06.210
I don't need the future prepared by Seven.

00:18:08.250 --> 00:18:13.170
The final possibility
that Seven could not predict.

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:15.170
Your choice.

00:18:16.380 --> 00:18:18.050
Find it, Konoha.

00:18:19.510 --> 00:18:21.180
Find your choice.

00:18:22.050 --> 00:18:24.180
We will change the future!

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:36.610
The only thing that we can change

00:18:37.110 --> 00:18:38.780
is the future!

00:19:07.520 --> 00:19:08.810
Dakky?

00:19:15.900 --> 00:19:17.820
She's back! She's alive!

00:19:17.900 --> 00:19:19.820
It's a miracle! A miracle has happened!

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:22.820
It seems the child whose heart stopped
has been safely resuscitated.

00:19:23.450 --> 00:19:25.830
I cannot report any longer.
It's amazing. A miracle.

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:29.330
-The Anshin is…
-Entering the atmosphere.

00:19:39.010 --> 00:19:41.130
Dark. Dark, what's wrong?

00:19:46.050 --> 00:19:48.850
Bright, what are you going to do?

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:51.480
Touya, I have a message from Dark.

00:19:52.310 --> 00:19:54.650
Let's meet again
in the unpredictable future.

00:19:54.730 --> 00:19:56.110
Until then.

00:19:57.690 --> 00:19:59.230
Dakky!

00:20:10.950 --> 00:20:12.960
ANSHIN

00:20:13.710 --> 00:20:19.130
Dark says,
"Thank you, but I will not say goodbye."

00:20:19.710 --> 00:20:24.380
We hope we were helpful to everybody.

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:33.060
HALF A YEAR LATER

00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:34.440
Even half a year later,

00:20:34.520 --> 00:20:37.520
the full story on the Lunatic Comet
Incident remains a mystery.

00:20:38.190 --> 00:20:44.200
It is suspected that the UN2's
extermination of several AIs is related.

00:20:44.860 --> 00:20:49.030
But because of the children's actions,
as well as that of their drones,

00:20:49.620 --> 00:20:54.040
the only casualty was a female
Anshin employee, who was 21.

00:20:54.670 --> 00:20:59.750
There are rumors that it was this woman
who perpetrated the terrorist acts.

00:21:00.380 --> 00:21:04.680
I wonder why only the videos of Nasa
waving a gun around are missing.

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:07.050
SELFIE: MARKET CAPITALIZATION
16 MILLION YEN

00:21:07.140 --> 00:21:08.300
What is this weird message?

00:21:08.390 --> 00:21:09.550
TO THE EXTRATERRESTRIAL
BOYS AND GIRLS

00:21:10.510 --> 00:21:11.970
Propelled by the incident,

00:21:12.060 --> 00:21:16.690
the UN2.1 policy that restricted
AI intelligence has come under fire.

00:21:16.770 --> 00:21:21.230
And in just half a year,
a new organization-- UN3.0--

00:21:21.320 --> 00:21:24.700
has launched and moved its headquarters
to Tallinn, Estonia.

00:21:24.780 --> 00:21:26.200
LIVING ON EARTH IN TALLINN
AFTER GRAVITY PT

00:21:26.280 --> 00:21:29.070
As the first international
open-government institution, UN3…

00:21:30.240 --> 00:21:33.910
The videos that were taken on the scene
by Mina Misasa

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:37.580
are considered the biggest
body of evidence on the incident.

00:21:37.670 --> 00:21:39.580
Mina, everybody!

00:21:39.670 --> 00:21:42.380
Mina Misasa,
who owns the rights to the videos,

00:21:42.460 --> 00:21:45.630
was inundated with publication
and film adaptation offers

00:21:45.720 --> 00:21:49.760
and today is considered
the 21st most wealthy person in the world.

00:21:49.850 --> 00:21:50.850
DONATION

00:21:50.930 --> 00:21:54.470
However, most of the proceeds
were donated to aid victims of the event,

00:21:54.560 --> 00:21:59.100
and there are rumors that she is investing
in an AI restoration-and-training venture.

00:21:59.190 --> 00:22:02.730
On top of it all, she became a teenager
who is famous space-wide

00:22:02.820 --> 00:22:05.740
not just as someone
involved in the incident,

00:22:05.820 --> 00:22:07.700
but for entirely different actions.

00:22:08.820 --> 00:22:10.240
Perhaps due to her influence,

00:22:10.320 --> 00:22:13.120
the number of those migrating to space
has doubled in the last half year,

00:22:13.200 --> 00:22:15.580
and the pace continues to accelerate.

00:22:15.660 --> 00:22:17.620
Most of those individuals
are young people.

00:22:17.710 --> 00:22:22.460
Some statistics say that at this pace
of migration, within 50 years' time,

00:22:22.540 --> 00:22:27.470
Earth's population
will be reduced by 36.79%.

00:22:27.550 --> 00:22:31.850
Hey, are there any fragments
of the implant left in my head?

00:22:31.930 --> 00:22:33.720
None at all.

00:22:33.810 --> 00:22:37.770
There are no vestiges
of the implant left whatsoever.

00:22:38.600 --> 00:22:41.520
How long can I stay here?

00:22:42.520 --> 00:22:47.940
In terms of your freeloading, my dad said
you could stay for as long as you want.

00:22:48.030 --> 00:22:49.030
I see.

00:22:49.110 --> 00:22:50.490
WORKING FOR UN3
WHILE ATTENDING GRADUATE SCHOOL

00:22:50.570 --> 00:22:52.280
But, Touya, don't you want to go back?

00:22:52.870 --> 00:22:53.700
What?

00:22:53.780 --> 00:22:55.370
To leave Earth.

00:22:55.450 --> 00:22:58.290
Well, it is home.

00:22:59.120 --> 00:23:01.750
Thanks to my dad's work at the UN3

00:23:01.830 --> 00:23:05.210
and the implants
that you and Konoha developed,

00:23:05.300 --> 00:23:09.010
the hurdle to extraterrestrial entry
is significantly lower for minors.

00:23:09.090 --> 00:23:10.550
You can go anytime.

00:23:11.090 --> 00:23:12.220
Yeah.

00:23:12.300 --> 00:23:15.060
I plan to settle down here for a while
and work.

00:23:15.140 --> 00:23:16.520
With the UN3?

00:23:17.680 --> 00:23:23.060
Yeah. I want to do work
that protects the cradle we are in.

00:23:23.690 --> 00:23:26.070
There are many people
who want to leave the cradle,

00:23:26.150 --> 00:23:28.570
but there are also many who need it.

00:23:30.400 --> 00:23:33.070
We're still toddling around,

00:23:33.160 --> 00:23:36.700
so I think just getting in and out
of the cradle is plenty for now.

00:23:37.490 --> 00:23:40.160
Furthermore,
nearly all of the comet's mass

00:23:40.250 --> 00:23:43.670
has evaporated and turned to dust
scattered around Earth,

00:23:43.750 --> 00:23:47.250
and the maximum average global
temperature has dropped by one degree.

00:23:47.880 --> 00:23:51.260
First Seven concluded that the destruction
of Earth's environment

00:23:51.340 --> 00:23:54.970
could not be resolved
without reducing the population on Earth,

00:23:55.050 --> 00:23:59.020
but preliminary estimates show
that it has bought us some time.

00:23:59.100 --> 00:24:02.190
They say this ring
will disappear after a few months,

00:24:02.270 --> 00:24:05.610
but there is an inexplicable effect
from a component contained in the dust.

00:24:05.690 --> 00:24:08.730
One theory is that Seven's
micro machine has influenced…

00:24:09.570 --> 00:24:11.740
Well? Do you remember the spot?

00:24:11.820 --> 00:24:13.070
LIVING IN TALLINN SUBURBS WITH MOTHER

00:24:13.160 --> 00:24:14.410
No, I can't remember.

00:24:14.490 --> 00:24:16.490
If I could just remember this part,

00:24:16.580 --> 00:24:18.290
I could figure out how the comet

00:24:18.370 --> 00:24:22.000
extracted such an enormous amount
of energy from the water.

00:24:22.080 --> 00:24:23.370
Me too.

00:24:23.460 --> 00:24:26.380
It feels like it was something
that happened in a dream.

00:24:27.880 --> 00:24:29.630
Hey, Touya.

00:24:30.510 --> 00:24:31.510
What?

00:24:31.590 --> 00:24:34.510
Why did you go down to Earth?
You hated it so much.

00:24:35.590 --> 00:24:38.180
I didn't go down to Earth.

00:24:38.260 --> 00:24:39.390
What?

00:24:39.470 --> 00:24:41.270
I flew.

00:24:41.850 --> 00:24:43.060
What do you mean?

00:24:43.140 --> 00:24:44.810
14-YEAR-OLD BOYS
LAUNCHED IMPLANT BUSINESS

00:24:44.900 --> 00:24:47.190
The big guy told me back then.

00:24:47.270 --> 00:24:49.980
"Fly out from your cradle."

00:24:50.070 --> 00:24:51.320
Cradle?

00:24:51.400 --> 00:24:54.110
Cradles vary by individual.

00:24:54.200 --> 00:24:56.820
For me, it was space.

00:24:56.910 --> 00:24:58.330
NEXT-GENERATION IMPLANTS
TOUYA SAGAMI, CEO OF FiTsZ

00:24:58.410 --> 00:25:01.620
It means flying out from where you
feel secure to a place you fear

00:25:01.700 --> 00:25:03.290
and going beyond.

00:25:04.000 --> 00:25:07.830
When I came into contact with that being,
I got smarter, and that's how I knew.

00:25:07.920 --> 00:25:09.920
That was why I flew out from space.

00:25:11.170 --> 00:25:12.590
So did I.

00:25:12.670 --> 00:25:15.380
I flew out too.

00:25:16.430 --> 00:25:18.680
From the cradle of fate.

00:25:19.970 --> 00:25:21.010
Yeah.

00:25:22.220 --> 00:25:25.060
But there's one thing I don't understand.

00:25:25.140 --> 00:25:26.440
What's that?

00:25:26.520 --> 00:25:28.730
No matter how we estimate it,

00:25:28.810 --> 00:25:33.190
I don't think a third of humanity would
die, given the comet's mass and speed.

00:25:33.280 --> 00:25:39.200
From the data UN2 took using AI
at the time, it had a very small mass.

00:25:39.780 --> 00:25:43.120
UN2 had been deceived by Seven all along.

00:25:44.000 --> 00:25:46.330
Does that mean that Seven--

00:25:46.410 --> 00:25:47.540
Yeah.

00:25:47.620 --> 00:25:49.330
Touya! I found them!

00:25:49.960 --> 00:25:53.590
Bright and Dakky fragments have
been found on Smarts here and there.

00:25:54.170 --> 00:25:59.300
They spread their own fragments
in the peer comm buffers.

00:25:59.390 --> 00:26:02.470
That's why they wouldn't say goodbye.
Then that means--

00:26:02.560 --> 00:26:05.980
Yes, we can restore them
almost completely to how they were.

00:26:08.440 --> 00:26:09.980
What's the message?

00:26:10.060 --> 00:26:11.980
TO THE EXTRATERRESTRIAL
BOYS AND GIRLS

00:26:13.070 --> 00:26:14.230
An earthquake?

00:26:18.410 --> 00:26:20.370
Why are they dropping down here?

00:26:21.570 --> 00:26:25.000
Here comes your investor.
Is your research progressing?

00:26:25.700 --> 00:26:28.160
Not like I'd understand.

00:26:28.250 --> 00:26:29.330
Mina?

00:26:29.420 --> 00:26:31.500
Didn't you have a concert on the moon?

00:26:31.580 --> 00:26:35.800
I came back from that yesterday
on the private shuttle.

00:26:35.880 --> 00:26:37.510
But I got this strange message.

00:26:38.090 --> 00:26:39.260
Me too.

00:26:39.760 --> 00:26:40.760
Hiroshi?

00:26:40.840 --> 00:26:43.100
Hakase, you got the message too?

00:26:43.180 --> 00:26:44.640
YOUNGEST IG NOBEL PRIZE WINNER

00:26:44.720 --> 00:26:46.020
Yes. Did all of you guys too?

00:26:46.100 --> 00:26:50.020
Yeah,
but the place it says to go to is odd.

00:26:50.600 --> 00:26:54.150
Yes. Could you all show me your letters?

00:26:55.110 --> 00:26:59.110
It's a simple encryption.
If you line up all five--

00:26:59.200 --> 00:27:00.910
What? This is strange.

00:27:00.990 --> 00:27:05.040
It looks like it isn't only five people
that will be coming to this location.

00:27:12.500 --> 00:27:14.170
What is this place?

00:27:14.250 --> 00:27:16.420
These are the Linnahall ruins.

00:27:27.470 --> 00:27:30.690
We are short one person.

00:27:37.070 --> 00:27:38.280
What is it?

00:27:41.910 --> 00:27:43.490
Do you hear that?

00:27:43.570 --> 00:27:44.700
Yeah.

00:27:51.790 --> 00:27:54.750
I wonder if that little one
called us here.

00:27:58.550 --> 00:28:01.800
It's calling from farther away now.

00:28:02.470 --> 00:28:03.470
Yeah.

00:28:05.600 --> 00:28:07.720
We should hurry up and go there.

00:29:41.650 --> 00:29:45.070
Subtitle translation by:
Noelle Marie Hollister
